{
  "uid": "blu-monitoramento",
  "title": "BLU - Monitoramento do serviço de vagas",
  "tags": [
    "blu",
    "bentoml",
    "mlops"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Serviço: tráfego, erros e latência (métricas do BentoML)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pedidos (5 min)",
      "description": "Pedidos de inferência recebidos (os dois endpoints).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-blu"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(bentoml_service_request_total{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Erros 4xx (5 min)",
      "description": "Respostas 4xx divididas pelo total de pedidos. São pedidos recusados por erro de quem chama (ex.: arquivo que não é imagem), não falhas do serviço. O just carga manda 10% de arquivos inválidos de propósito.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-blu"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(bentoml_service_request_total{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\",http_response_code=~\"4..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(bentoml_service_request_total{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.3
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Falhas 5xx (5 min)",
      "description": "Respostas 5xx divididas pelo total de pedidos: o serviço falhou ao responder um pedido válido. Deve ficar em 0%.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-blu"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(bentoml_service_request_total{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\",http_response_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(bentoml_service_request_total{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.001
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 estimado (5 min)",
      "description": "95% dos pedidos ao /prever_ocupacao (respostas 200) terminaram em até este tempo, ESTIMADO pelas faixas do histograma do BentoML (100, 250, 500 ms...). Entre duas faixas o valor é interpolado, então pode errar bastante; o valor exato está ao lado. Vermelho acima do SLA de exemplo de 400 ms.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-blu"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(bentoml_service_request_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint=\"/prever_ocupacao\",http_response_code=\"200\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.4
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 exato (últimos 100)",
      "description": "95% dos últimos 100 pedidos ao /prever_ocupacao terminaram em até este tempo, calculado pedido a pedido a partir do log pelo exportador de drift (painel BLU - Estatísticas). Vermelho acima do SLA de exemplo de 400 ms.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-blu"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "blu_janela_latencia_ms{endpoint=\"/prever_ocupacao\",estatistica=\"p95\"} / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.4
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ocupação média (5 min)",
      "description": "Fração das vagas detectadas que estavam ocupadas, em média nos últimos 5 minutos (média no tempo da ocupação da última imagem, amostrada a cada 5 s). É a informação de negócio do serviço.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-blu"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "avg_over_time(blu_taxa_ocupacao[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pedidos por segundo, por endpoint e status",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-blu"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (endpoint, http_response_code) (rate(bentoml_service_request_total{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{endpoint}} {{http_response_code}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taxa de erros: cliente (4xx) × servidor (5xx)",
      "description": "4xx: pedidos recusados por erro de quem chama (arquivo inválido). 5xx: falhas do serviço. Só o 5xx indica problema no serviço.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-blu"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(bentoml_service_request_total{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\",http_response_code=~\"4..\"}[1m])) / sum(rate(bentoml_service_request_total{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "4xx (cliente)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(bentoml_service_request_total{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\",http_response_code=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(bentoml_service_request_total{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx (servidor)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "4xx (cliente)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "5xx (servidor)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência de /prever_ocupacao: estimada (histograma) × p95 exato",
      "description": "p50/p95/p99 estimados pelas faixas do histograma do BentoML (respostas 200) e, em branco, o p95 exato dos últimos 100 pedidos (exportador de drift). A diferença entre o p95 estimado e o exato mostra o erro da interpolação entre faixas largas. A linha vermelha tracejada é o SLA de exemplo (400 ms). Escala logarítmica, para o pico do primeiro pedido (que carrega o modelo e leva segundos) não achatar o resto.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-blu"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(bentoml_service_request_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint=\"/prever_ocupacao\",http_response_code=\"200\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 estimado",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(bentoml_service_request_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint=\"/prever_ocupacao\",http_response_code=\"200\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 estimado",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(bentoml_service_request_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint=\"/prever_ocupacao\",http_response_code=\"200\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 estimado",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "blu_janela_latencia_ms{endpoint=\"/prever_ocupacao\",estatistica=\"p95\"} / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95 exato",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            },
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "log",
              "log": 10
            }
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.4
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p95 exato"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "white"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Histograma da latência ao longo do tempo",
      "description": "Inferências (respostas 200). Cada coluna é um minuto; a cor é a quantidade de pedidos em cada faixa de latência. As faixas acima de 10 s ficam de fora (o serviço não chega perto delas).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-blu"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-blu"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (le) (increase(bentoml_service_request_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint=~\"/prever_ocupacao.*\",http_response_code=\"200\",le!~\"30.0|60.0|120.0|180.0\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "heatmap"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "show": true,
          "yHistogram": true
        },
        "calculate": false,
        "yAxis": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "cellGap": 1,
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Oranges",
          "steps": 64
        }
      }
    },
